WEBVTT

00:00:03.278 --> 00:00:05.962
First, the knowledge base index.

00:00:05.962 --> 00:00:13.308
Open Search, Indexes, click Add index, and click Add on AI Knowledge Base Index for Elasticsearch.

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:18.654
Enter an Index Name and a Name, and pick the Embedding deployment.

00:00:18.654 --> 00:00:22.040
It cannot be changed after the index is created.

00:00:22.499 --> 00:00:23.558
Click Save.

00:00:23.558 --> 00:00:28.540
Data sources, file sources and web crawlers all store their passages in an

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.159
index like this one.

